sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as KFP SDK / Dashboard
    participant API as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP | 8887/TCP gRPC
    participant MySQL as MySQL / MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows Controller
    participant Driver as Driver<br/>Init Container
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata gRPC<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Launcher as Launcher<br/>Sidecar
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant SWC as Scheduled Workflow Controller

    Note over SDK,Launcher: Flow 1: Pipeline Submission and Execution

    SDK->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Bearer token (multi-user)
    API->>MySQL: Store pipeline metadata<br/>mysql-secret auth
    API->>S3: Store pipeline definition<br/>AWS credentials
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s->>Argo: Schedule Workflow execution

    Argo->>Driver: Inject init container
    Driver->>MLMD: Resolve inputs, record execution<br/>gRPC
    Driver-->>Argo: Pod spec patch applied

    Argo->>Launcher: Inject sidecar
    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>AWS credentials
    Note over Launcher: Execute user container
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>AWS credentials

    PA->>K8s: Watch Workflow status<br/>ServiceAccount token
    PA->>API: Report run status<br/>gRPC/8887

    Note over SDK,SWC: Flow 2: Scheduled / Recurring Pipeline Runs

    SDK->>API: Create RecurringRun<br/>Bearer token
    API->>K8s: Create ScheduledWorkflow CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    SWC->>K8s: Watch ScheduledWorkflow CRs<br/>ServiceAccount token
    SWC->>K8s: Create Workflow at schedule<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s->>Argo: Execute scheduled Workflow
